{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"forge_l3","model_identifier":"forge_l3","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# forge_l3\n\nIronworks (forge level 3): a stone smithy with a bigger brick furnace and a waterwheel that works the bellows through a rocking beam.\n\n- Footprint: 10 x 8 columns (160 x 128 units, 4.50 x 3.60 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -78..76, y -0..162, z -64..64 units.\n- Texture: 512 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 70, construction_0 31, construction_33 42, construction_66 63, ruined 33 (6 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- smithy: 104 x 166 x 72 centred at x -20, z 4\n- wheel: 12 x 66 x 64 at x 56, z 0\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `forge_l3_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `forge_l3_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_forge_l3` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `working` | 4.0 | loop | `wheel` turns once per 4 s. `rocker` beam rocks twice per turn, pumping the furnace bellows. |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (-40, 0, -41)\n- `fx_smoke` at (-10, 163, 4)\n- `fx_flame` at (-10, 14, -60)\n- `slot_work` at (-56, 0, -64)\n- `slot_dropoff` at (-40, 0, -46)\n"},"resolution":{"width":512,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"smithy_found","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-74.0,0.0,-34.0],"to":[34.0,3.0,42.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[232.0,295.0,340.0,298.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[340.0,295.0,416.0,298.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[232.0,295.0,340.0,298.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[340.0,295.0,416.0,298.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[283.0,0.0,391.0,76.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[283.0,0.0,391.0,76.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"8260eaf0-d7f6-5958-96b1-0db5cddee0f1"},{"name":"smithy_w0_n","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-72.0,3.0,-32.0],"to":[32.0,87.0,-28.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[66.0,0.0,170.0,84.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[234.0,0.0,238.0,84.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[66.0,0.0,170.0,84.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[234.0,0.0,238.0,84.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[10.0,286.0,114.0,290.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[10.0,286.0,114.0,290.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"88cc0480-dc71-5ca6-b5ea-b94bf6baf317"},{"name":"smithy_w0_s","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-72.0,3.0,36.0],"to":[32.0,87.0,40.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[66.0,0.0,170.0,84.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[238.0,0.0,242.0,84.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[66.0,0.0,170.0,84.0],"tex